{"sourceUrl":"https://ee.jlu.edu.cn/info/1038/9586.htm","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:50:13.423466+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://ee.jlu.edu.cn/info/1038/9586.htm","html":"<div><div>\n<p> </p>\n<p><span><span><br/></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>吉林大学</span></span><span><span>电子科学与工程学院创建于</span><span>1959年，前身为吉林大学半导体系</span></span><span><span>，</span></span><span><span>由高鼎三院士主持创办</span></span><span><span>，</span></span><span><span>开辟我国半导体器件的研究先河，有</span></span><span><span>“天下第一系”之称。学院现</span></span><span><span>在拥有两个一级学科（电子科学与技术、生物医学工程）和一个专业博士学位授权点（电子信息）。</span></span><span><span>电子科学与技术一级学科博士学位授予权点涵盖四个二级学科</span></span><span><span>（</span></span><span><span>微电子学与固体电子学、物理电子学、电路与系统、电磁场与微波技术</span></span><span><span>）</span></span><span><span>均具有博士和硕士学位授予权，微电子学与固体电子学为国家重点二级学科、首批博士学位授权单位；电子信息专业博士、硕士学位授权点设有两个专业领域（新一代电子信息技术（含量子技术等）、集成电路工程）。</span><span>2017年，“电子科学与技术”学科被列为教育部首批“双一流”自主建设学科、吉林大学首批建设的一流学科（群）。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>为促进</span></span><span><span>全国</span></span><span><span>高校优秀大学生之间的</span></span><span><span>沟通与</span></span><span><span>交流</span></span><span><span>，</span></span><span><span>激发青年学生投身半导体事业的热情，吸引优秀大学生加入吉林大学电子科学与工程学院，学习黄大年先生</span><span>“北上精神”，特举办“2026年校园学术开放日”活动，具体通知如下：</span></span></p>\n<p><strong><span><span>一、</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>活动举办目的</span></span></strong></p>\n<p><span>1.使学生了解学院、导师、学科优势，扩大学科影响力。</span></p>\n<p><span>2.通过参观访问集成光电子全国重点实验室</span><span><span>，以</span></span><span><span>开放交流打破信息壁垒。</span></span></p>\n<p><strong><span><span>二、</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>申请条件</span></span></strong> </p>\n<p><span>1.</span><span><span>全国各高校电子类相关专业</span><span>202</span></span><span><span>7</span></span><span><span>届本科毕业生</span></span><span><span>。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>2</span></span><span><span>.</span></span><span><span>对</span></span><span><span>电子领</span></span><span><span>域的</span></span><span><span>学术</span></span><span><span>研究有浓厚兴趣，有</span></span><span><span>一定</span></span><span><span>的科研潜力</span></span><span><span>。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>3</span></span><span><span>.英语水平良好</span></span><span><span>，</span></span><span><span>应通过大学英语四级考试或达到同等英语水平</span></span><span><span>。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>4.品行端正，遵纪守法，身心健康</span></span><span><span>。</span></span></p>\n<p><strong><span><span>三、活动形式及时间安排</span></span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span><span>1.报名安排：</span></span></strong><span><span>即日</span></span><span><span>——</span></span><span><span>2026年6</span></span><span><span>月</span></span><span><span>18</span></span><span><span>日</span></span><span><span>，</span></span><span><span>报名网址</span></span><span><span>：</span></span><span><span>https://yzbbm.jlu.edu.cn/。</span></span><span><span>仅填写第一志愿即可，请认真准确填报</span></span><span><span>。</span></span></p>\n<p><strong><span><span>加入</span><span>QQ群：所有</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>申请人</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>本人实名加入</span><span>QQ群1056178644（验证信息：姓名-所在学校），方便及时沟通和获取后续信息。</span></span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span><span>2.资格审</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>查：</span></span></strong><span><span>2026年6月15日——6月23日，在</span></span><span><span>报名系统</span></span><span><span>中个人</span></span><span><span>确定</span></span><span><span>是否录用</span></span><span><span>，</span></span><span><span>提交电子版材料完成资格审查，</span></span><span><span>提交</span></span><span><span>网址为：</span></span><span><span>https://jluese.wjx.cn/vm/w5dCJXE.aspx。</span></span><span><span>逾期未提交视为自动放弃，资格审查不合格不予通过。</span></span></p>\n<p><strong><span><span>3.公示情况：</span></span></strong><span><span>2026年6月26日前，</span></span><span><span>在吉林大学电子科学与工程学院网站</span></span><span><span>“</span></span><span><span>研究生工作</span><span>”栏公布，</span></span><span><span>网址：</span></span><a href=\"http://ee.jlu.edu.cn/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span><span>http://ee.jlu.edu.cn/</span></span></a><span><span>，请及时关注网站</span></span><span><span>并按期参加活动</span></span><span><span>。</span></span></p>\n<p><strong><span><span>4.具体安排：</span></span></strong><span><span>2026年7月2日-7月4日，</span></span><span><span>吉林省长春市吉林大学中心校区唐敖庆楼</span><span>D区，线下形式。</span></span></p>\n<table>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><p><span><span>7月2日</span></span></p></td>\n<td><p><span><span>上午</span></span></p></td>\n<td><p><span><span>校园学术开放日来访学生报到</span></span></p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><br/></td>\n<td><p><span><span>中午</span></span></p></td>\n<td><p><span><span>午餐</span></span></p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><br/></td>\n<td><p><span><span>下午</span></span></p></td>\n<td><p><span><span>校园学术开放日启动仪式、学院整体介绍、分组参观实验室</span></span></p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><br/></td>\n<td><p><span><span>晚上</span></span></p></td>\n<td><p><span><span>“晚伴”组合，与相关课题组师生自由活动</span></span></p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><p><span><span>7月3日</span></span></p></td>\n<td><p><span><span>上午</span></span></p></td>\n<td><p><span><span>专题学术报告</span></span></p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><br/></td>\n<td><p><span><span>中午</span></span></p></td>\n<td><p><span><span>午餐</span></span></p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><br/></td>\n<td><p><span><span>下午</span></span></p></td>\n<td><p><span><span><span>现场综合学术交流展示</span></span></span></p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><br/></td>\n<td><p><span><span>晚上</span></span></p></td>\n<td><p><span><span>“晚伴”组合，与相关课题组师生自由活动</span></span></p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><p><span><span>7月4日</span></span></p></td>\n<td><p><span><span>上午</span></span></p></td>\n<td><p><span><span>城市校园文化游、校园学术开放日闭幕式</span></span></p></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p><strong><span><span>四</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>、</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>资格审查提交材料</span></span></strong></p>\n<p><span><span>1.《报名表》（</span></span><span><span>网上报名后</span></span><span><span>系统</span></span><span><span>自动生成</span></span><span><span>）；</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>2.</span></span><span><span>个人简历（见附件模板）</span></span><span><span>；</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>3.学生证</span></span><span><span>扫描件</span></span><span><span>（</span></span><span><span>含学生照片和信息页</span></span><span><span>）；</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>4.成绩单扫描件（加盖公章）；</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>5</span></span><span>.其他</span><span><span>能证明个人成绩及潜力的材料</span></span><span><span>（</span></span><span><span>包括已发表学术论文等首页、检索页；校级</span></span><span><span>以上</span></span><span><span>获奖</span></span><span><span>证书；</span></span><span><span>英语</span><span>4/6级成绩单；TOEFL成绩，GRE/GMAT成绩单扫描件等）；</span></span></p>\n<p><strong><span><span>五</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>、</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>活动内容</span></span></strong></p>\n<p><span><span>现场综合学术交流展示，以面对面交流展示形式开展综合素养沟通，围绕专业知识、逻辑思辨、语言表达、问题研判、创新思路、外语口头交流、思想品德等维度开展沟通交流。</span></span></p>\n<p><strong><span><span>六</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>、</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>其</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>它</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>说明</span></span></strong></p>\n<p><span><span>1.校园学术开放日</span></span><span><span>活动</span></span><span><span>期间，我院为</span></span><span><span>所有</span></span><span><span>来访学生</span></span><span><span>购买人身意外伤害保险</span></span><span><span>（请提供准确身份证号码）</span></span><span><span>、提供</span></span><span><span>7月2日和3日两天住</span></span><span><span>宿（</span></span><span><span>长春</span></span><span><span>市本地</span></span><span><span>来访学生</span></span><span><span>不安排住宿）</span></span><span><span>、</span></span><span><span>提供</span><span>7月2日和3日两天中午统一餐食</span></span><span><span>。</span></span><span><span>交通费自理。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>2.为保证活动质量，我们将限制人数，故不能满足所有同学的申请，欢迎所有应届生报考我院推免生和统考生。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>3.</span></span><span><span>如</span></span><span><span>与</span></span><span><span>学校或学院重大事宜冲突，将变更时间，届时将在学院主页</span></span><span><span>“</span></span><span><span>研究生工作</span><span>”栏</span></span><span><span>和</span><span>QQ群公布，请各位</span></span><span><span>成员</span></span><span><span>随时关注。</span></span></p>\n<p><strong><span><span>七</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>、联系方式</span></span></strong></p>\n<p><span><span>地</span>  <span>址：吉林省长春市前进大街</span><span>2699号吉林大学电子科学与工程学院唐敖庆楼D区324室研究生工作办公室</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>联系人：闻老师</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>电</span>  <span>话：</span><span>0431-85168416</span></span></p>\n<p><strong><span><span>欢迎有意报考</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>吉林大学电子科学与工程学</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>院研究生的</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>学</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>生</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>踊跃</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>报名</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>，</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>相信你会有所收获</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>！</span></span></strong></p>\n<p> </p>\n<p><span><span>电子科学与工程</span></span><span><span>学院</span></span></p>\n<p><span>202</span><span><span>6</span></span><span><span>年</span></span><span><span>6</span></span><span><span>月</span></span><span><span>12</span></span><span><span>日</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><br/></span></span></p>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>\n</div></div>","textSha256":"65696d768b47871d4012ce28d7b7a04b48737562b504ef48d55faeaf232f4393","textLength":1734,"sourceSha256":"88f10d3b15d45a4a120c7b0114876f49d0d187535fb153a502548cce6c083e52","selector":"#vsb_content","attachments":[{"name":"附件 简历.docx","url":"https://ee.jlu.edu.cn/system/_content/download.jsp?urltype=news.DownloadAttachUrl&owner=1402736124&wbfileid=18143359"}],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-e7698ad8897ba319d09b","title":"2026年吉林大学电子科学与工程学院“2026年校园学术开放日”活动通知","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:50:13.423466+00:00"}
